      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ecb155/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-28T13:00:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The text on Rigged Explosives says that the attack originates from the explosive itself (exact wording below). I would be inclined to say that he is actually vulnerable to the attack. Same with the text on Automated Hunter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...flip the trap and remove it. If it is an explosive, it first makes this attack.\"</p>",
