      "raw": "<p>The text on Rigged Explosives says that the attack originates from the explosive itself (exact wording below). I would be inclined to say that he is actually vulnerable to the attack. Same with the text on Automated Hunter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&quot;...flip the trap and remove it. If it is an explosive, it first makes this attack.&quot;</p>",
