      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-30T02:19:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's for the help, everyone!<br><br>More questions I have:<br><br>With melee attacks against Omnitron(who is always one elevation higher) I'm guessing rolls of 1 never hit?<br><br>Since they are his own attacks, Ambuscade can 'Aim' his explosives, correct?&nbsp; and since he can only aim one attack, it would have to be against one selective target for each 'Aim' I use, right?</p>",
