      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>That&#39;s for the help, everyone!<br /><br />More questions I have:<br /><br />With melee attacks against Omnitron(who is always one elevation higher) I&#39;m guessing rolls of 1 never hit?<br /><br />Since they are his own attacks, Ambuscade can &#39;Aim&#39; his explosives, correct?&nbsp; and since he can only aim one attack, it would have to be against one selective target for each &#39;Aim&#39; I use, right?</p>",
