      "id": 143297,
      "name": "Bowie",
      "username": "Bowie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bowie/{size}/2097_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-20T20:26:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm gonna hijack this for a noob question:<br><br>Like in SotM, can I choose the order of resolution?<br><br>Proletariat can, if Powered right, rather than take 2 or&nbsp;more&nbsp;damage, take 1&nbsp;less&nbsp;damage and duplicate himself. Proletariat can also, if Powered right, rather than take 2 or more damage, ignore the attack and remove a duplicate.</p><p>Can I do both? Take 3 damage, which creates a duplicate, reduces to 2 damage, then gets ignored by removing the duplicate I just created?<br><br>Thanks.</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:20:42.031Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
