      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m gonna hijack this for a noob question:<br /><br />Like in SotM, can I choose the order of resolution?<br /><br />Proletariat can, if Powered right, rather than take 2 or&nbsp;more&nbsp;damage, take 1&nbsp;less&nbsp;damage and duplicate himself. Proletariat can also, if Powered right, rather than take 2 or more damage, ignore the attack and remove a duplicate.</p><p>Can I do both? Take 3 damage, which creates a duplicate, reduces to 2 damage, then gets ignored by removing the duplicate I just created?<br /><br />Thanks.</p>",
