      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-20T20:30:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can use one of the powers or the other, not both. &nbsp;The first one you choose will either negate the damage (preventing the other from triggering) or reduce the damage to 1 (so it no longer meets the minimum 2 damage requirement).</p><p>Any other true resolution issues are decided by the player who's turn it is (the order targets are hit in an area attack, etc.)</p>",
